          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cukɛ detkiɛn naŋ kɛ ɣɔ̱ɔ̱kiɛn kɛ muɔ̱likiɛn, ŋɔak diaal tëë te rɛy wec amäni tëë te dɔɔr. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cukɛ kuakiɛn diaal pɛc kɛnɛ gaatkiɛn kɛ mänkiɛn, cu mäni tin diaal tin te rɛy ti̱ecni cukɛ kɛ thol. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛn wa̱nɔ cu Je-kɔb Cim-on kɛnɛ Lii-bay ku jiök i̱, “Yɛn cia ɣä jak kä ram mi ba nyir ɛ ji̱ Kɛ-naan kɛnɛ ji̱ Pɛ-rii-dhi tin ciaŋkɛ ro̱l ɛmɛ, kä cia kɛ̈kdä ya̱r rɛydiɛn. Mi wäkɛ rɔ̱ mat, bikɛ ɣä mak piny, kä bä cu li̱w kɛɛl kɔnɛ thok duëëlä, kɛ ɣöö kuiy nɛɛkä.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ kac nhial kɛ jɛ i̱, “A dëëkɔ nyimaara ku jak kä cieŋɛ ce̱tkɛ ram mi riär?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.31"
            ]
          }
        }
